Penumbra: Overture - PortMaster port
====================================

Licence: GPL-3.0-or-later, inherited and unavoidable. LICENSE is the GPL v3 text
verbatim.

The game sources under PenumbraOverture/ are Frictional Games' GPL release of
Penumbra: Overture, by way of HPL1 Rehatched (zenmumbler). Three files there are
zenmumbler's own additions and carry no Frictional header; the other 113 keep
their 2006-2010 Frictional Games headers. Only two of them carry changes made
for this port, src/Init.cpp and src/PlayerState_Interact.cpp. The build files,
launch scripts and packaging here were written by Omka1337 with the help of
Claude Code.

What is tracked under rehatched/ is not retail data: seven .hps map scripts,
English.lang, resources.cfg, one GUI sound and zenmumbler's material-checking
tooling, all inherited from HPL1 Rehatched.

The engine, and the third-party libraries it bundles, live in the HPL1 Fledged
repository - see its NOTICE for those licences. Nothing third-party is vendored
here.

No game data is included. Penumbra: Overture's assets remain the property of
Frictional Games; a player needs their own copy of the game.
